XephiraOS Vendor Configuration
==============================

Welcome to the XephiraOS vendor repository (`vendor/lineage`).

For the comprehensive device tree specification, maintainer configuration variables, system properties, and build instructions, please refer to:
[README.md](README.md)

Quick Device Configuration Summary
----------------------------------
To configure your device tree for XephiraOS, define the following in your `xephira_<device>.mk` or `lineage_<device>.mk`:

* `XEPHIRA_MAINTAINER := YourName`
* `XEPHIRA_MAINTAINER_URL := https://github.com/...`
* `XEPHIRA_SOC := Your SoC Name` (e.g. Snapdragon 8 Gen 2)
* `XEPHIRA_BATTERY := 5000 mAh`
* `XEPHIRA_DISPLAY_SPEC := 6.7" 120Hz AMOLED`
* `XEPHIRA_CAMERA := 50MP Main + 12MP Ultra-wide`

See [README.md](README.md) for full documentation and makefile examples.
